From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: agent3 <agent3@localhost>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 16:10:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] stm32mp257-dk: expose remaining secure EXTI2 lines to Linux

Same as EXTI1: lines 21-24, 37, 38, 43, 44, 47, 49, 52, 54, 62-68
and 76 guarded peripherals that are now non-secure or an unused M33.
Flip them NSEC with CID filtering disabled.

